  "details": "First image:\n\nIn red: The date shown in the event details on the calendar, in Brazilian Portuguese (pt-BR), repeats the day of the week twice. In the example, it should be written as: 9 de agosto de 2025 | sábado. The day and month should be lowercase.\n\nIn blue: In this case, only the first letter should be capitalized, with the rest in lowercase.\n\nSecond image:\n\nThese sentences are also not available in Crowdin. I’m also not sure if it's possible to fix this by only following the instructions at https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/dotnet/standard/base-types/custom-date-and-time-format-strings.",
